<details><summary>{{ __('How a record gets flagged') }}</summary>
    <p>{{ __('The recorded origin is read from the description\'s provenance: the location of its earliest recorded owner. Until the museum fields of phase 21, there is no place of creation or of discovery to read.') }}</p>
    <p>{{ __('Where it is held is the country of its repository\'s contact details, or else the location of its latest recorded owner.') }}</p>
    <p>{{ __('Both are reduced to a country or broad region. A record is flagged only when BOTH are known and they differ.') }}</p>
    <p>{{ __('Empty or unrecognised values are treated as unknown and never flagged. The intent is high precision: few false flags, even at the cost of missing some.') }}</p>
</details>
